# Marketing.Rules.2VP.Master

> Single source of truth for how the 2VP marketing site is built, ranked,
> tracked and converted. Everything that previously lived in chat threads,
> audit notes and code comments is consolidated here. If a rule below
> conflicts with an ad-hoc decision, this document wins. Edits to this
> file are the only sanctioned way to change the rules.

- **Owner:** 2VP marketing (hi@2vp.uk · 020 8050 8968)
- **Scope:** 2vp.uk, all sub-paths, and any future micro-sites bearing the 2VP name
- **Last consolidated:** 2026-05-11
- **Living document:** review at the start of every quarter and after any algorithm-level Google update

