## 5. Site information architecture

**A-1.** Routes are:

```
/                          → home
/areas                     → index of all 59
/areas/[slug]              → 59 area landing pages
/services/[slug]           → 4 service hubs (roadmap, week 3)
/insights                  → editorial / blog (roadmap, week 7)
/insights/[slug]           → individual posts
/calculator                → external (2vp.uk/calculator)
/book                      → external (2vp.uk/book)
/api/lead                  → form receiver, server-only
/privacy                   → legal (roadmap, week 1)
/terms                     → legal (roadmap, week 1)
/sitemap.xml               → auto-generated
/robots.txt                → auto-generated
```

**A-2.** Maximum click depth from home to any monetised page (area page, service page) is **2**. Maximum depth from home to any leaf page is **3**.

**A-3.** Every page must link to: (a) home, (b) `/areas`, (c) the calculator, (d) the booking form, (e) the privacy policy.

**A-4.** No JavaScript-only routes. Every monetised page is statically generated and indexable.

